      "writtenOn": "2023-06-01T01:40:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I found some test using `com/android/testutils/HandlerUtils.kt` but it has the same issue as it will post a task and then wait until it has been executed, but if there are new message posted on the handler it will say it is idle when it is not.\n\nSome other are mocking/spying it and are using a [TestLoopper](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/refs/heads/master:frameworks/base/tests/utils/testutils/java/android/os/test/TestLooper.java) with` dispatchAll()`\n\nThat may do some trick. Let me investigate this",
